summary: Basic test for oslat
description: |
    Unit test for the oslat subpackage of the rt-tests package.
    Runs oslat command for a specified duration and optionally
    checks if latency exceeds the maximum threshold.
contact: Shizhao Chen <shichen@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - stalld
  - numactl
  - numactl-libs
  - procps-ng
duration: 3h
